  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting education &amp; identifying gaps/needs in Albanian maritime sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims to strengthen the maritime sector in Albania, with focus on maritime competence and development of ports in Albania. Project also foresees mapping out the status, gap analysis and opprotunities in maritime sector in Albania.</narrative>
  </description>
